---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <h1>🐉 Hello, Legionnaire!</h1>
      <img src="/asuka.png" alt="Asuka Welcome" />
      <p>
        Welcome to the official blog of the Blackfyre Legion! Our Codex have
        information about our members and of course related to our Imperator,
        Blackfyre himself. Feel free to enjoy our posts, may that be written by
        Blackfyre or pulled with our agreggator.
      </p>
      <p>
        The blog posessess a lot of opinions, fanboyolism, nerdy, autistic and
        weird stuff. Here I don't hold back on my feelings on the subject in
        question no matter what it is. I try to not offend anyone, of course I
        will not atack a person, game, series, movies or anything with no
        reason.
      </p>
      
     <p>
        You wanna know more info about how this blog was made? Check out
        <a href="https://github.com/CelsoBlackfyre/">Minimal Blog</a>
        by <a href="https://twitter.com/EmpBlackfyre">Imperator Blackfyre</a>.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
